### Login (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@rodieja.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Status scripts / files
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export — download portable .sql.gz (also refreshes 04_datos.sql + schema snapshot)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Import full dump (.sql or .sql.gz) — set file path locally
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/database/import
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
#
# --WebAppBoundary
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sistema_vehicular.sql.gz"
# Content-Type: application/gzip
#
# < ./sistema_vehicular.sql.gz
# --WebAppBoundary--
